OL,3,AProtesters start fires and clash with
OL,4,Apolice as school demonstrations spread
OL,5,Aacross France
OL,6,
OL,7,FStudents, parents and trade unions are
OL,8,Fdemonstrating across France, in protest
OL,9,Fat what they say is under-investment in
OL,10,Fhigh schools
OL,12,FOne union says 1,800 high schools are
OL,13,Fblockaded or closed, with 90% of
OL,14,Funiversities also blockaded - the
OL,15,Fgovernment says 891 schools across
OL,16,FFrance have classes suspended, either
OL,17,Ftotally or partially
OL,19,FIn Strasbourg, there were scuffles
OL,20,Fbetween police and protesters; in Lyon,
OL,21,Fa barricade was set on fire; while in
OL,22,FRennes, police used water cannon
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
