OL,3,AProtesters start fires and clash with
OL,4,Apolice as school demonstrations spread
OL,5,Aacross France
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn Paris, one 17-year-old tells us she
OL,8,Fstudies in "overcrowded" classes of 35:
OL,9,F"We have been fighting for so many
OL,10,Fthings...we still feel like we are not
OL,11,Fbeing heard"
OL,13,FIn the past week, students have
OL,14,Fblockaded hundreds of schools with at
OL,15,Fleast 215 injured and more than 5,000
OL,16,Fpeople arrested
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
